Optional properties, in addition to those specified by the shared
matrix-keyboard bindings:
- autorepeat: bool: enables key autorepeat
- st,mode: keyboard mode: 0 - 9x9, 1 - 6x6, 2 - 2x2

Example:

kbd@fc400000 {
